/* CodeBurn Menubar — 简体中文 (zh-Hans).
 *
 * Keys are the English development copy; see en.lproj/Localizable.strings for
 * the conventions. Format specifiers (%@, %lld, %%) must stay identical to the
 * English entry, in the same order — LocalizationCatalogTests fails the build
 * otherwise, because a mismatch is a crash or a wrong number at runtime.
 *
 * Untranslated on purpose: provider, model and plan names (Claude, Codex,
 * Gemini, Opus, Sonnet, Antigravity…), units, currency codes, shell commands
 * and file paths, and anything the `codeburn` CLI produces.
 */


