"Codex live-quota tracking follows the authoritative `~/.codex/auth.json` session directly and does not create a second Keychain copy. A legacy CodeBurn Keychain item, when present, is read only as a migration fallback. Only ChatGPT-mode auth (Plus / Pro / Team / Business / Edu / Enterprise) is supported. API-key users are billed per request and have a different reporting surface. Credit-metered workspaces report no rate-limit windows, so their monthly credit allowance is shown instead." = "Codex 实时配额跟踪直接沿用权威的 `~/.codex/auth.json` 会话，不会创建第二份钥匙串副本。若存在旧版 CodeBurn 钥匙串项目，仅作为迁移回退读取。仅支持 ChatGPT 模式认证（Plus / Pro / Team / Business / Edu / Enterprise）。使用 API 密钥的用户按请求计费，报告方式不同。按点数计量的工作区不报告限流窗口，因此会改为显示其每月点数额度。";
