"Gemini live-quota tracking reads `~/.gemini/oauth_creds.json` read-only. Nothing is copied or stored, and tokens stay in memory. If the connection shows as expired, run the Gemini CLI once to refresh your login, then click Reconnect." = "Gemini 实时配额跟踪以只读方式读取 `~/.gemini/oauth_creds.json`，不会复制或存储任何内容，令牌仅保留在内存中。若连接显示为已过期，请运行一次 Gemini 命令行工具以刷新登录，然后点按“重新连接”。";
